{"content":[{"c":["TIMNA (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Daughter of Seir, sister of Lotan, and a native Horite inhabitant of Edom (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.22","r":"Gen.36.22","rawR":"Gen.36.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.22","value":"Gen.36.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.39","r":"1Chr.1.39","rawR":"1Chr.1.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.39","value":"1Chr.1.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:39"},"). She was a concubine to Eliphaz, Esau’s son, and the mother of Amalek (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.12","r":"Gen.36.12","rawR":"Gen.36.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.12","value":"Gen.36.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Edomite chief (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.36.40","r":"Gen.36.40","rawR":"Gen.36.40","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.36.40","value":"Gen.36.40"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 36:40"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.36,51","r":"1Chr.1.36,51","rawR":"1Chr.1.36,51","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.36,51","value":"1Chr.1.36,51"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:36, 51"},"). This name may refer either to the name of the ancestor of the Edomite clan or to the geographical area occupied by the clan."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"TimnaPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 36:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.22","rawQueryValue":"Gen.36.22","sourceRefExact":"Gen.36.22"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.39","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.39","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.39"},{"anchorText":"Gn 36:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.12","rawQueryValue":"Gen.36.12","sourceRefExact":"Gen.36.12"},{"anchorText":"Gn 36:40","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.36.40","rawQueryValue":"Gen.36.40","sourceRefExact":"Gen.36.40"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:36, 51","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.36,51","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.36,51","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.36,51"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"42200655d0a7b36d86a9ad9ea907d6cc2c17631d203a81264b0fe9a3445bd64e","sourceItemName":"TimnaPerson","sourceItemOrder":160,"sourceMember":"Articles/T.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"TimnaPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Timna (Person)","title":"Timna (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}